>13</span><span data-bn=\"Data Quality Dimension\" data-en=\"Data Quality Dimensions\">Data Quality Dimensions</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values/\"><span>14</span><span data-bn=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid ও Outlier Value\" data-en=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values\">Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"tidy-data-and-organization\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/tidy-data-and-organization/\"><span>15</span><span data-bn=\"Tidy Data ও Data Organization\" data-en=\"Tidy Data and Data Organization\">Tidy Data and Data Organization</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"frequency-tables-and-summary-views\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/frequency-tables-and-summary-views/\"><span>16</span><span data-bn=\"Frequency Table ও Summary View\" data-en=\"Frequency Tables and Summary Views\">Frequency Tables and Summary Views</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"analytical-questions-and-metrics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/analytical-questions-and-metrics/\"><span>17</span><span data-bn=\"Analytical Question ও Metric Definition\" data-en=\"Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics\">Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"exploratory-data-analysis-workflow\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/exploratory-data-analysis-workflow/\"><span>18</span><span data-bn=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\" data-en=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\">Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"reproducible-analysis-and-documentation\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/reproducible-analysis-and-documentation/\"><span>19</span><span data-bn=\"Reproducible Analysis ও Documentation\" data-en=\"Reproducible Analysis and Documentation\">Reproducible Analysis and Documentation</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use/\"><span>20</span><span data-bn=\"Data Ethics, Privacy ও Responsible Use\" data-en=\"Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use\">Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"mini-project-retail-data-audit\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/mini-project-retail-data-audit/\"><span>21</span><span data-bn=\"Mini Project: Retail Dataset Audit\" data-en=\"Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset\">Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a></div></nav>\n<div class=\"tutorial-sidebar-links\"><a href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Exercises</a><a href=\"/quiz/data-foundations/\">Final quiz</a><a href=\"/examples/data-foundations/\">Examples</a><a href=\"/references/data-foundations/\">References</a></div>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\"></div>\n<article class=\"tutorial-content\" data-chapter=\"measurement-scales\" data-tutorial=\"data-foundations\">\n<header class=\"tutorial-page-header\"><div>\n<span class=\"eyebrow\" data-bn=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 7 / 21\" data-en=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 7 of 21\">Data Foundations · Chapter 7 of 21</span>\n<h1 data-bn=\"Measurement Scale\" data-en=\"Measurement Scales\">Measurement Scales</h1>\n<p class=\"tutorial-lead\" data-bn=\"Nominal, ordinal, interval ও ratio scale কোন comparison ও arithmetic defensible তা বর্ণনা করে। Practical variable দিয়ে hierarchy শিখুন।\" data-en=\"Nominal, ordinal, interval, and ratio scales describe what comparisons and arithmetic are defensible. Learn the hierarchy through practical variables.\">Nominal, ordinal, interval, and ratio scales describe what comparisons and arithmetic are defensible. Learn the hierarchy through practical variables.</p>\n</div><div class=\"tutorial-header-actions\"><button class=\"button ghost tutorial-drawer-open\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-open\" type=\"button\">☰ <span data-bn=\"Chapter\" data-en=\"Chapters\">Chapters</span></button><button class=\"button ghost\" onclick=\"window.print()\" type=\"button\">⎙ <span data-bn=\"Print\" data-en=\"Print\">Print</span></button></div></header>\n<div class=\"chapter-meta\"><span>◷ 40 min</span><span>Beginner</span><button class=\"button small primary\" id=\"chapter-complete\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav aria-label=\"On this chapter\" class=\"chapter-jump\"><a href=\"#objectives\">Objectives</a><a href=\"#concept-1\">Learn</a><a href=\"#worked-example\">Example</a><a href=\"#try-it\">Try it</a><a href=\"#exercises\">Exercises</a><a href=\"#summary\">Summary</a></nav>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section tutorial-objectives\" id=\"objectives\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Start here</div><h2 data-bn=\"আপনি যা শিখবেন\" data-en=\"What you will learn\">What you will learn</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"চারটি common measurement scale define করুন।\" data-en=\"Define the four common measurement scales.\">Define the four common measurement scales.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Variable-এর সঙ্গে defensible operation match করুন।\" data-en=\"Match variables to defensible operations.\">Match variables to defensible operations.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Ordinal code-কে precise distance হিসেবে treat করা এড়ান।\" data-en=\"Avoid treating ordinal codes as precise distances.\">Avoid treating ordinal codes as precise distances.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Ratio-এর জন্য zero কেন গুরুত্বপূর্ণ explain করুন।\" data-en=\"Explain why zero matters for ratios.\">Explain why zero matters for ratios.</span></li></ul></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-1\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">01</div><h2 data-bn=\"Nominal ও ordinal\" data-en=\"Nominal and ordinal\">Nominal and ordinal</h2><p data-bn=\"Nominal value inherent order ছাড়া name: blood group, district বা product type। Ordinal value-এর order আছে কিন্তু spacing unequal বা unknown: satisfaction level, education stage বা priority। Rank compare করা যায়, কিন্তু step distance equal guaranteed নয়।\" data-en=\"Nominal values are names without inherent order: blood group, district, or product type. Ordinal values have order but unequal or unknown spacing: satisfaction levels, education stage, or priority. You can compare rank, but the distance from “satisfied” to “very satisfied” is not guaranteed equal to another step.\">Nominal values are names without inherent order: blood group, district, or product type. Ordinal values have order but unequal or unknown spacing: satisfaction levels, education stage, or priority. You can compare rank, but the distance from “satisfied” to “very satisfied” is not guaranteed equal to another step.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-2\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">02</div><h2 data-bn=\"Interval ও ratio\" data-en=\"Interval and ratio\">Interval and ratio</h2><p data-bn=\"Interval scale-এ equal difference meaningful কিন্তু true zero নেই, যেমন Celsius; 20°C 10°C-এর দ্বিগুণ গরম নয়। Ratio scale-এ equal interval ও meaningful zero, যেমন weight, duration, quantity বা revenue; ratio meaningful হতে পারে।\" data-en=\"Interval scales have meaningful equal differences but no true zero, such as temperature in Celsius; 20°C is not twice as hot as 10°C. Ratio scales have equal intervals and a meaningful zero, such as weight, duration, quantity, or revenue, so ratios can be meaningful.\">Interval scales have meaningful equal differences but no true zero, such as temperature in Celsius; 20°C is not twice as hot as 10°C. Ratio scales have equal intervals and a meaningful zero, such as weight, duration, quantity, or revenue, so ratios can be meaningful.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-3\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">03</div><h2 data-bn=\"Scale কেন গুরুত্বপূর্ণ\" data-en=\"Why scale matters\">Why scale matters</h2><p data-bn=\"Measurement scale valid summary ও model guide করে। Nominal data count; ordinal data median ও rank method; interval ও ratio data difference ও numerical summary support করে। Real variable-এ domain judgment প্রয়োজন।\" data-en=\"Measurement scale guides valid summaries and models. Nominal data use counts; ordinal data often use medians and rank methods; interval and ratio data support differences and many numerical summaries. Real variables may require domain judgment.\">Measurement scale guides valid summaries and models. Nominal data use counts; ordinal data often use medians and rank methods; interval and ratio data support differences and many numerical summaries. Real variables may require domain judgment.</p></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section key-terms\" id=\"key-terms\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Vocabulary</div><h2 data-bn=\"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ শব্দ\" data-en=\"Key terms\">Key terms</h2><div class=\"term-grid\"><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Nominal\" data-en=\"Nominal\">Nominal</h3><p data-bn=\"Inherent order ছাড়া category।\" data-en=\"Categories without inherent order.\">Categories without inherent order.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Ordinal\" data-en=\"Ordinal\">Ordinal</h3><p data-bn=\"Unknown বা unequal spacing-সহ ordered category।\" data-en=\"Ordered categories with unknown or unequal spacing.\">Ordered categories with unknown or unequal spacing.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Interval\" data-en=\"Interval\">Interval</h3><p data-bn=\"Equal difference meaningful, কিন্তু zero absence নয়।\" data-en=\"Equal differences are meaningful, but zero is not an absence.\">Equal differences are meaningful, but zero is not an absence.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Ratio\" data-en=\"Ratio\">Ratio</h3><p data-bn=\"Equal difference ও meaningful zero ratio support করে।\" data-en=\"Equal differences and a meaningful zero support ratios.\">Equal differences and a meaningful zero support ratios.</p></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section worked-example\" id=\"worked-example\">\n<div class=\"section-kicker\">Example</div><h2 data-bn=\"চার variable, চার scale\" data-en=\"Four variables, four scales\">Four variables, four scales</h2><p class=\"example-context\" data-bn=\"payment_method, service_priority, temperature_c ও order_value analyze করুন।\" data-en=\"Analyze payment_method, service_priority, temperature_c, and order_value.\">Analyze payment_method, service_priority, temperature_c, and order_value.</p>\n<ol class=\"worked-steps\"><li><span>1</span><p data-bn=\"payment_method nominal।\" data-en=\"payment_method is nominal.\">payment_method is nominal.</p></li><li><span>2</span><p data-bn=\"service_priority ordinal।\" data-en=\"service_priority (low, medium, high) is ordinal.\">service_priority (low, medium, high) is ordinal.</p></li><li><span>3</span><p data-bn=\"temperature_c interval।\" data-en=\"temperature_c is interval.\">temperature_c is interval.</p></li><li><span>4</span><p data-bn=\"order_value ratio, কারণ zero monetary value absence বোঝায় এবং ratio interpretable।\" data-en=\"order_value is ratio because zero means no monetary value and ratios are interpretable.\">order_value is ratio because zero means no monetary value and ratios are interpretable.</p></li></ol>\n<div class=\"example-conclusion\"><strong data-bn=\"Conclusion\" data-en=\"Conclusion\">Conclusion</strong><p data-bn=\"Scale কোন comparison logically defensible তা নির্ধারণ করে।\" data-en=\"The scale determines which comparisons are logically defensible.\">The scale determines which comparisons are logically defensible.</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section try-it-section\" id=\"try-it\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Try it yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"ধারণাটি প্র্যাকটিস করুন\" data-en=\"Practice the idea\">Practice the idea</h2><div id=\"tutorial-activity\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section exercise-section\" id=\"exercises\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Check yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"Chapter exercise\" data-en=\"Chapter exercises\">Chapter exercises</h2><div id=\"chapter-exercises\"></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Open the complete exercise library →</a></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section recap-section\" id=\"summary\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Summary</div><h2 data-bn=\"যা মনে রাখবেন\" data-en=\"What to remember\">What to remember</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Nominal মানে order ছাড়া label।\" data-en=\"Nominal means labels without order.\">Nominal means labels without order.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Ordinal মানে ordered category।\" data-en=\"Ordinal means ordered categories.\">Ordinal means ordered categories.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Interval difference support করে, meaningful ratio নয়।\" data-en=\"Interval supports differences, not meaningful ratios.\">Interval supports differences, not meaningful ratios.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Ratio-এর meaningful zero থাকে।\" data-en=\"Ratio has a meaningful zero.\">Ratio has a meaningful zero.</span></li></ul></section>\n<details class=\"tutorial-references\"><summary>Authoritative references</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/introductory-statistics-2e/pages/1-3-frequency-frequency-tables-and-levels-of-measurement\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">OpenStax — Frequency Tables and Levels of Measurement ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/introductory-statistics-2e/pages/1-1-definitions-of-statistics-probability-and-key-terms\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">OpenStax — Definitions of Statistics, Probability, and Key Terms ↗</a></li></ul></details>\n<div class=\"tutorial-complete-panel\"><div><h2 data-bn=\"পরবর্তী chapter-এর জন্য প্রস্তুত?\" data-en=\"Ready for the next chapter?\">Ready for the next chapter?</h2><p data-bn=\"ধারণাটি explain ও exercise finish করতে পারলে chapter complete mark করুন।\" data-en=\"Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.\">Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.</p></div><button class=\"button primary\" id=\"chapter-complete-bottom\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav class=\"tutorial-pager\"><a class=\"tutorial-prev\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/discrete-and-continuous-data/\"><small>← Previous</small><strong data-bn=\"Discrete ও Continuous Data\" data-en=\"Discrete and Continuous Data\">Discrete and Continuous Data</strong></a><a class=\"tutorial-next\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-structures-and-formats/\"><small>Next →</small><strong data-bn=\"Structured, Semi-structured ও Unstructured Data\" data-en=\"Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data\">Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data</strong></a></nav>\n</article>\n</div></main>","scripts":["/assets/js/tutorial-core.js","/assets/js/tutorial.js"],"inlineScripts":[]}